            10
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Jesse Mentioned in Jesus' Genealogy",
      "description": "Jesse is mentioned in both genealogies of Jesus in the New Testament, confirming Jesus as the promised Messiah from David's line.",
